o Iga Świątek, and everyone who lost to Iga Świątek is ranked highly by the WTA, it follows that all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 are ranked highly by the WTA.\n   - Coco Gauff is mentioned as a player who lost to Rafael Nadal.\n   - According to the last point, if Coco Gauff is a player who is ranked highly by the WTA or a player who lost to Rafael Nadal, then Coco Gauff is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022.Based on the given context, the statement "Coco Gauff is among the most active players in major tennis" is false.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
