messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B or C. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nA hawk never lands. Some birds are hawks.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or uncertain? All birds land\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Uncertain', '<think>.\nTo determine whether the statement "All birds land" is true, false, or uncertain based on the given context, we need to analyze the information provided step by step.\n\n1.**Understanding the Context:**.\n   - The context states that a hawk never lands.\n   - It also mentions that some birds are hawks.\n\n2.**Analyzing the Statement:**.\n   - The statement claims that "All birds land.".\n   - This means that every single bird must land at some point.\n\n3.**Evaluating the Information:**.\nSince we know that a hawk never lands, it follows that all birds do not land. Furthermore, the context does not specify whether hawks, being birds, land or not.\n\n4.**Conclusion:**.\n   - Based on the fact that a hawk never lands, we can infer that not all birds land.\n   - Hence, the assertion "All birds land" is inaccurate.\n\n<answer>\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
