   - Since all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 lost to Iga Świątek, and everyone who lost to Iga Świątek is ranked highly by the WTA, it follows that all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 are ranked highly by the WTA.\n   - Coco Gauff is mentioned as a player who is ranked highly by the WTA or a player who lost to Rafael Nadal.\n   - Since all male tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 lost to Rafael Nadal, and Coco Gauff is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022 (as per the given condition), it implies that Coco Gauff must be a female tennis player.\n\n3.**Evaluating the Statement**:The statement claims that Coco Gauff is not a player who lost to Iga Świątek or one of the most active players in major tennis, but based on the context, it is evident that all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 did not lose to Iga Świątek, and since Coco Gauff is a female tennis player, she did not lose to Iga Świątek. Furthermore, as Coco Gauff is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022, she can be considered one of the most active players in major tennis (as per the context).\n\n4.**Conclusion**:\n   - Given the information, Coco Gauff is not a player who lost to Iga Świątek and is one of the most active players in major tennis.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:\n**B) False**\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
