ply store regularly.\n   - If people spend their free time tidying and organizing the spaces in their home, then they do not go to bed late and wake up every day after noon.\n   - Remy either both goes to bed late and wakes up every day after noon and spends their free time tidying and organizing the spaces in their home, or they do not go to bed late and wake up every day after noon nor spend their free time tidying and organizing the spaces in their home.\n\n2.**Identify Relevant Information**:\n   - The statement we need to evaluate is: "Remy has a fully stocked and impressive home office and also visits the office supply store regularly."\n   - From the context, we know that if someone works regularly and often at home, they visit the office supply store regularly.However, this does not directly imply that Remy has a fully stocked and impressive home office.\n\n3.**Evaluate the Statement**:\nThe statement "Remy has a fully stocked and impressive home office and also visits the office supply store regularly" can be definitively confirmed or denied based on the given context. There is a direct link between Remy having a fully stocked and impressive home office and visiting the office supply store regularly.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:\n<answer>A) Certain</answer>\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
