ip between Luke and his siblings:**.\n   - We know that Luke either is both a twin or triplet and develops strong bonds with his family members, or he neither is a twin or triplet nor develops strong bonds with his family members.\n\n4.**Evaluate the implications for Luke\'s behavior:**.\n   - Since Luke either develops strong bonds with his family members or does not, we need to consider both scenarios:.\n     - If Luke develops strong bonds with his family members, it implies that he likely lives at home regularly and spends time with his siblings.If Luke develops strong bonds with his family members, it is more likely that he would complain often about annoying siblings, as he might feel neglected or unimportant.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
